Adaptation 07-opus-medium-effort

Added here, not in the fork. The owner's rule: a role that runs on Opus runs at medium reasoning.
A value without an `@` suffix that resolves to an Opus model runs at `medium`, whatever the sheet's
`default effort` line, a platform mapping, Pi's panel line or poteto-mode's per-job adjustment
would give it; an explicit `@<level>` suffix still wins, and an `opus` value that a runtime maps to
another vendor's model keeps the default effort.

Applies to the port's plugins/pstack/skills tree after the patches numbered before it.

